{"sections":[{"slug":"椭圆曲线的模叠","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"椭圆曲线的模叠"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">椭圆曲线的模叠</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"椭圆曲线的模叠"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">椭圆曲线是带一个标记点</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">亏格为</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的代数曲线</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">椭圆曲线的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/分类叠","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模叠</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/曲线的模叠","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">曲线的模空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal M_{1,1}$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">朴素模空间</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">复数上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/椭圆曲线","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">椭圆曲线</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的同构类一一对应于</span> $\\mathbb{C}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的格点</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $\\mathcal M =\\mathbb{H}/\\mathrm {SL}_2(\\mathbb{Z})$ <span lang=\"zh\">的点</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\mathbb H$ <span lang=\"zh\">是上半平面</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">紧化</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">椭圆曲线的模叠有一紧化</span> $\\overline{\\mathcal M_{\\text{ell}}}$, <span lang=\"zh\">加入了结点三次曲线</span> (nodal cubic curve). <span lang=\"zh\">再加入尖点三次曲线</span> (cuspidal cubic curve) <span lang=\"zh\">就得到所有三次曲线的模叠</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">椭圆曲线的模叠是其中对应于非奇异曲线的部分</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/模形式","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模形式</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/椭圆曲线的模问题","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">椭圆曲线的模问题</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Teichmüller空间","text":"Teichmüller <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Tate曲线","text":"Tate <span lang=\"zh\">曲线</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}